  <CATEGORY Name="GameOver">
	<Entry Name="DeathHint_General_1">FRAGMENT #1878945: This can't be real, can it? The way I move, the world I see.[br]I ask myself: Is it a dream, or is it truly reality?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="DeathHint_General_2">FRAGMENT #6582312: They call the alignment of the planets syzygy. What shall we call the alignment of universes? Surely, as there are an immeasurable amount of worlds scattered throughout the cosmos, so to are there realities - waiting to be explored.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="DeathHint_General_3">FRAGMENT #2491863: The rifts between worlds manifest without warning. You must be quick on your feet, sound of judgement, and ready to embrace what comes next. But do take care, for these gateaways are open to all who choose to enter.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="DeathHint_General_4">FRAGMENT #5014427: Each world, each universe, is so very different from the next. Vast mining colonies, bizarre cube-shaped structures, and warehouses filled with cruel experiments. It is all so very interesting.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="DeathHint_General_5">FRAGMENT #7854934: The focus of reality is split between myraid states. It is within these fragments that you find every joy, every sorrow, every dream laid out on the canvas of existence. This is divinty, and it is a privilege to have witnessed it.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="DeathHint_General_6">FRAGMENT #7854934: Be wary of the spaces between spaces. The universes between universes. They are fissures which seek to swallow you whole, realms of pure misery and chaos. They are not meant for us.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="DefaultMessage">You died</Entry>
    <Entry Name="PressToContinue">Press any button to load latest save...</Entry>
