  <CATEGORY Name="BunkersEdgeHints">
	<Entry Name="HintBEMomentum">Keep moving forward without stopping to build momentum. Clean movement increases your speed and strengthens parkour moves.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEVault">Press $Input{Jump} while moving toward a low obstacle to vault it.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBELedge">Jump toward a reachable ledge to grab and climb it automatically.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBESlide">Press $Input{Crouch} while moving forward with speed to slide. Press $Input{Jump} during a slide to leap.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBERoll">Press $Input{Run} just before landing from a fall to roll and avoid a hard landing.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEWallRun">With forward momentum, press $Input{Jump} beside a wall to wall-run. Press $Input{Jump} again to jump away.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEWallScramble">With forward momentum, press $Input{Jump} toward a wall to scramble upward. Press $Input{Jump} again to jump away.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEWallJump">When jumping to a wall, press $Input{LeanLeft}/$Input{LeanRight} to turn around and perform a wall jump. Press $Input{Jump} again to jump to the next wall. You can also perform this while wall running.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEBeam">Use $Input{Forward} and $Input{Backward} to move along a beam. Use $Input{Left} and $Input{Right} to correct your balance.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEPoleClimb">Use $Input{Forward} and $Input{Backward} to climb or slide on a pole. Press $Input{Jump} to jump off or $Input{Crouch} to drop.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEPoleSwing">Use $Input{Forward} and $Input{Backward} to build your swing. Press $Input{Jump} to release or $Input{Crouch} to drop.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEZipline">Jump into a zipline to grab it automatically. Press $Input{Crouch} to drop.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEDie">You are standing in the dead room. If you stay here too long, you will die!</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEDie2">There is a 50% chance that you will return to da Bunker, and a 50% chance that you will JUST DIE.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEDie3">This is called a "coin toss". Do not question this analogy.</Entry>
	<Entry Name="HintBEDie4">You ready? Say cheese!</Entry>
  </CATEGORY>
